ops: list .5in;\">Camera</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Our representative&nbsp;<strong>at 7:00 am</strong>&nbsp;will Pick you up &nbsp;to move &nbsp;<strong>to El Ein El Sokhna</strong>&nbsp;where it`s about 120 K/M from Cairo upon arrive there After 2 hours ,you will spend a day use Room and enjoy your day on the red sea. Lunch is included.</p>\r\n<p>Around 6:00 pm transfer you back to Cairo.</p>'),
(54, 'day', 'Alexandria day tour to visit Alexandria highlight from Alexandria', 'Alexandria', '1789315650_tour.jpeg', 85.00, 125.00, 85.00, '7 Hours', '9:00 AM', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Full day Private tour includes all Pickup and drop off transfers from your Hotel in Alexandria, Lunch at Local restaurant not including Beverages, Professional English-speaking tour guide, all transfers by a modern A/C vehicle, Bottle water during your trip, all service charges &amp; taxes, Tour excludes Personal Items, Tipping and Optional activities.</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\">1-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Transportation in private air-conditioned van.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">2-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">3-&nbsp;&nbsp;All Transfers as mentioned.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">4- bottle of water for each person</p>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the temples or tombs from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Comfortable shoes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap\">\r\n<h6 class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title\">Itinerary</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\">\r\n<p>At 9:00 am Pickup <strong>Alexandria port or your Hotel in Alexandria</strong> by Our expert Licensed Tour guide then start your Full Day tour visiting the best sites in Alexandria Start with <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">library of Alexandria </span>the biggest library in the world now with 8 million books, Site of the ancient lighthouse it&rsquo;s one of the seven wonders of ancient world, Palaces of Farouk, last king in history of Egypt.<br>Then visit pompays pillar, remains of ancient library of Alexandria,&nbsp;<br>Then Visit <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">The Catacombs</span>. Dates back to 3rd century its mixture between Greek, Roman, Egyptian art.<br>Then stop for lunch in best sea view restaurant in Alexandria Based on Full Meal for each Person but Beverages are not included.<br>After lunch Visit the Modern monuments Such as unknown soldier of Alexandria, the statue of Alexander the great, drive along the Cornish to see the whole city passing over bridge of stanly land mark of modern Alexandria then at 16:00 drive back to your ship. or youir hotel in Alexandria</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
