Cairo from the Crusaders where you will visit <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the mosque of Mohamed Ali</strong></span>, the founder of modern Egypt, and his mosque is a Turkish style mosque and called the Alabaster mosque then stop for lunch in one of the local Restaurants(optional), After that our guide will pick you up to<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> the Egyptian Civilization Museum</strong></span> which displays a rare collection of 5000 years of art. Over 250,000 genuine artifacts are presented, including an exhibit dedicated to Tutankhamen collection of treasure, gold, and jewelry which was enclosed in his tomb for over 3,500 years ,During the day, you will also have the chance to visit a Papyrus Museum to see how the famous paper is made, After that back to your hotel .</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Also you can add a night tour to the day tour as like:</strong><br>&ndash;<a href=\"https://egyptsquaretemp-com.stackstaging.com/tour/fascinating-cairo-dinner-cruise-on-nile/\">Cairo Dinner Cruise</a>.<br>&ndash;<a href=\"https://egyptsquaretemp-com.stackstaging.com/tour/sound-and-light-show-at-giza-pyramids/\">Sound and Light Show at Giza Pyramids</a>.<br>&ndash;<a href=\"https://egyptsquaretemp-com.stackstaging.com/tour/tour-to-wekalet-el-ghoury-for-tanoura-egyptian-heritage-dance-show/\">Al Tannoura Egyptian Heritage Show at Wekalet El Ghory</a> .</p>'),
(129, 'half', 'Cairo half day Tour to Memphis & Sakkara Pyramids', 'Cairo', '1789267982_tour.jpeg', 55.00, 75.00, 55.00, '4 Hours', ' 8:00am', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p><strong>Private Tour includes all Pick up &amp; drop off transfers from guest&prime;s location in Cairo, expert tour guide, All Taxes Services, (Bottle of Water) and All Transfers by Private modern A/C Vehicle, Tour excludes personal items, tipping, Mummies Room and any Optional Tours.</strong></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\">1-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Transportation in private air-conditioned van.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">2-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">3-&nbsp;&nbsp;All Transfers as mentioned.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">4- bottle of water for each person</p>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking confirmation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Comfortable shoes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Camera</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Our Egyptologist tour Guide will meet you at your hotel then you will go ahead to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Saqqara 2</strong>7</span> km southwest away from Cairo, where you can explore the first and oldest complete stone building complex known in history of the mankind which was built by Djoser during the third dynasty 2700 B c. times. Then move to Visit <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Memphis</strong></span> , the ancient capital of Egypt, where the colossal statue of Ramses II and the great Alabaster Sphinx 0f Queen Hatshepsut . This City Dates back to 3100 B.C, after that you will be transferred back to your Hotel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>');
INSERT INTO `tours` (`id`, `type`, `title`, `location`, `hero_image`, `price`, `price_single`, `price_group_small`, `duration`, `timing`, `languages`, `availability`, `overview`, `includes_html`, `excludes_html`, `brings_html`, `itinerary`) VALUES
(130, 'day', 'Historical Day Tour to Giza Pyramids, Saqqara and Dahshur Pyramids', 'Cairo', '1789267825_tour.jpeg', 75.00, 120.00, 75.00, 'Full Day', '7 :00am or 8:00am', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Join me on this special tour for History lovers and Pyramids Fans to Explore some of Egypt&rsquo;s Famous<br>Treasure site of Giza The Great Pyramid of Giza from Ancient Egypt has always demanded awe and recognition from us &lsquo;mortals&rsquo;, and rightly so. The incredible architectural specimen was built in around 2560 BC, then to Saqarra,&nbsp; The sacred cemetery and the virgin archaeological site keeps a lot of unsealed secrets in its hot sands. Proceed to Dahshur where is the bent pyramid and the red pyramid, Private day Tour Includes All Pick Up &amp; Drop Off from guests stay in Cairo or in Giza, Entry Fees, Expert Tour Guide, All Taxes Services, (Bottle of Water) And All Transfers by Private modern A/C Vehicles.<br>________________________________________<br>There is possibility to enter one of the pyramids from Inside, visiting solar boat of king Cheops, riding camel around of Giza pyramids or ridding the quad bike at the wide desert or serapium in Saqqara but all those excursions can be added on the middle of the tour as it requires additional fees</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\">1-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Transportation in private air-conditioned van.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">2-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">3-&nbsp;&nbsp;All Transfers as mentioned.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\">4- bottle of water for each person</p>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking confirmation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Comfortable shoes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Camera</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div id=\"itinerary\" class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\">\r\n<p>Our Egyptologist tour Guide will meet you at your hotel then you will go ahead to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Saqqara 27 </span>km southwest away from Cairo, where you can explore the first and oldest complete stone building complex known in history of the mankind which was built by Djoser during the third dynasty 2700 B c. Then Visit<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> Dahshur Pyramids (Bent and Red Pyramids)</strong></span> . Dahshur area is a royal necropolis located in the West Bank of the Nile approximately 40 kilometers south of Giza, Which Is known for its Pyramids, which considered as the oldest largest attempt to build a true Pyramid here in Egypt, built from 2613&ndash;2589 BC Then from there will go for lunch in a local restaurant with the view of the Giza pyramids (optional). After lunch go ahead to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Giza Pyramids and the Great Sphinx</strong></span>, the most famous monuments of ancient world! These massive stone structures were built around 4,500 years ago on a rocky desert plateau close to the Nile and always amaze visitors</p>\r\n<p>Finally, we drive you back to your hotel in Cairo.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Also you can add a night tour to the day tour as like:</strong><br>&ndash;<a href=\"https://egyptsquaretemp-com.stackstaging.com/tour/fascinating-cairo-dinner-cruise-on-nile/\">Cairo Dinner Cruise</a>.<br>&ndash;<a href=\"https://egyptsquaretemp-com.stackstaging.com/tour/sound-and-light-show-at-giza-pyramids/\">Sound and Light Show at Giza Pyramids</a>.<br>&ndash;<a href=\"https://egyptsquaretemp-com.stackstaging.com/tour/tour-to-wekalet-el-ghoury-for-tanoura-egyptian-heritage-dance-show/\">Al Tannoura Egyptian Heritage Show at Wekalet El Ghory</a> .</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-divider-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-mgb gdlr-core-divider-item-normal gdlr-core-center-align\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
(131, 'transfer', 'Transfer from Luxor to Aswan', 'Luxor / Aswan', '1789267432_tour.jpg', 95.00, 190.00, 95.00, '3.5 Hours', 'any time before 5:00 pm	', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Available upon request at any time modern Private A/C Van transfer. As Per requested time our Representative will pick you up from your location in Aswan then transfer to Luxor. Budget and CheapPrivate Transfer from Aswan to Luxor&amp; Taxi Services from Luxor to Aswan.</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking driver</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalC