of the Sites from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking confirmation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>As per requested time Our Driver will pick you up from your location in Luxor and transfer to Hurghada from Luxor in Private air Conditioned Van Vehicle to your Hotel in Hurghada. The Distance from Luxor to Hurghada is usually takes around 3 hours and half</p>'),
(133, 'day', 'Day tour to Luxor from Aswan by plane', 'Aswan / Luxor', '1789266989_tour.jpg', 95.00, 190.00, 95.00, '14 Hours', '6:00 am', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Here\'s your best chance to see the best heritage of Egypt and learn how the Egyptians make history. Take a fantastic tour to the massive<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> East Bank of Luxor</strong></span> by visiting <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>Karnak Temple</strong></span>, the greatest example of worship in the history, dedicated to the God Amon, his wife Mut and their son Khonsu. Then visiting<span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong> the Temple Of Luxor</strong></span>, it was built by Amunhotep III in 18th Dynasty in the New Kingdom and it was completed by Ramses II during the 19th Dynasty. Then we see <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the West Bank of Luxo</strong></span>r where you will visit <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>the Valley Of The Kings</strong></span>, the magnificence of the grandeur of architecture which was used for burial, there are many kings buried in this valley. Followed by a visit to <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut</strong></span> that was known as El Dir El Bahari which was built by Queen Hatshepsut, the only pharaonic woman who reigned ancient Egypt. Then continue your day Tour to <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>The Colossi of Memnon</strong></span> which has remains of the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III.</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking confirmation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Comfortable shoes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Camera</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>At 5:00 am will Pick you up from your <strong>Hotel or Nile Cruise in Aswan or even from Luxor airport,</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;then you will be transferred to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the West Bank of Luxor</strong></span> where you will visit <em><strong>the Valley Of The Kings</strong></em>, followed by a visit to<em><strong> the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut</strong></em>. Then continue your day Tour to <em><strong>The Colossi of Memnon</strong></em> which has remains of the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III. Then Transfer to the East Bank visiting<em><strong> Karnak Temple</strong></em>, the greatest example of worship in the history, dedicated to the main triad of Luxor (God Amon, his wife Mut and their son Khonsu). Finish your day tour by visiting <em><strong>the Temple Of Luxor</strong></em>, it was built by Amunhotep III in 18th Dynasty in the New Kingdom and it was completed by Ramses II during the 19th Dynasty. Later you will be driven back to your hotel in Luxor or to Luxor airport.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>&nbsp;Note :- I can customize your itinerary according to your needs or Interests please contact us for more details.</strong></span></p>'),
(134, 'half', 'Luxor Half Day Tour to East Bank of Luxor visiting Karnak & Luxor Temples', 'Luxor', '1789267201_tour.jpg', 65.04, 120.00, 65.04, '6 Hours', '7 am or 8am', '', '', '<p>Here\'s your best chance to see the best heritage of Egypt and learn how the Egyptians make history. Take a fantastic tour to the massive <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>East Bank of Luxor </strong></span>by visiting<em> <strong>Karnak Temple</strong>,</em> the greatest example of worship in the history, dedicated to the God Amon, his wife Mut and their son Khonsu. Then visiting <em><strong>the Temple Of Luxo</strong></em>r, it was built by Amunhotep III in 18th Dynasty in the New Kingdom and it was completed by Ramses II during the 19th Dynasty.</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Entry Fees</li>\r\n<li>Personal Items</li>\r\n<li>Tipping</li>\r\n<li>Lunch</li>\r\n<li>any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</li>\r\n</ul>', '', '<p>Here\'s your best chance to see the best heritage of Egypt and learn how the Egyptians make history.</p>\r\n<p>*-Take a fantastic tour to the massive<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> East</strong></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Bank of Luxor</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At 7:00 am will Pick you up from your Hotel or Nile Cruise in Luxor or even from Luxor airport</p>\r\n<p>, then you will be transferred to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the West Bank</strong></span> where you will visit<em><strong> the Valley Of The Kings</strong></em>, followed by a visit to the <em><strong>Temple of Queen Hatshepsut.</strong></em> Then continue your day Tour to The Colossi of Memnon which has remains of the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III.</p>'),
(135, 'half', 'Luxor Hot air Balloon ride in Luxor', 'Luxor', '1789264975_tour.jpeg', 105.00, 105.00, 105.00, '2 Hours', '', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Early morning move you will enjoy the beautiful view over the city of Luxor by the hot air balloon </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Lucida Sans Unicode\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Lucida Sans Unicode\';\">You have by now experienced the Valley of the Kings from the ground, before you leave Luxor, you can see the whole area from the air. The flights take off from the West bank at sunrise and last between 35 minutes and 45 minutes depending upon conditions on the day of your flight. This is a truly memorable experience at nearly half the price of flights in the UK.</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if