(136, 'day', 'Day tour to Giza Pyramids, Egyptian Museum and Bazaar from Sharm El Sheik by plane', 'Sharm / Cairo', '1789263384_tour.jpeg', 130.00, 250.00, 130.00, '14 Hours', '7:00 AM', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<div class=\"Box-styled__StyledBox-sc-b5e2b36f-0 cutTuS\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_132=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_133=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_136=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_137=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_138=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_139=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_140=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_141=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_150=\"1\">\r\n<h2 class=\"Typography-styled__TypographyContainer-sc-336ca359-0 ccvjIM\" align=\"left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Step into the Glory and Mastery of Earth&rsquo;s Most Extraordinary Civilization.</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"Box-styled__StyledBox-sc-b5e2b36f-0 fykIEQ\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_132=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_133=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_136=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_137=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_138=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_139=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_140=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_141=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_150=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"Box-styled__StyledBox-sc-b5e2b36f-0 cutTuS\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_132=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_133=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_136=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_137=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_138=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_139=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_140=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_141=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_150=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"Box-styled__StyledBox-sc-b5e2b36f-0 lmFxRu\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_132=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_133=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_136=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_137=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_138=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_139=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_140=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_141=\"1\" data-gtm-vis-has-fired96343767_150=\"1\">\r\n<p>Hours in Cairo but your heart craves adventure? Don&rsquo;t let the airport walls cage your curiosity. Step into the sun, feel the desert breeze, and gaze upon the timeless Giza Pyramids &mdash; a wonder that whispers stories of millennia. Make your layover unforgettable. Laugh, explore, marvel, and live a story you&rsquo;ll tell forever. Your Cairo adventure starts here &mdash; let&rsquo;s make magic happen! ✨ Don&rsquo;t waste time waiting &mdash; escape the airport and explore Egypt with me! 🚀🇪🇬</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Take a fantastic tour that will include:</p>\r\n<p>-&nbsp;<strong>pick up from&nbsp; your hotel to airport</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>pick up from&nbsp; Cairo airport</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- stop for breakfast (light local food</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the massive Pyramids of Giza</strong></span>( Khufu, Khafre, and Menkaure, the Sphinx, the valley temple of king Chephren). - enter one of the Pyramids, Great pyramid or the 3rd pyramid (optional).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- lunch (optional).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the Grand Egyptian Museum</strong></span>, containing over 120. 000 pieces of Pharaonic history, each piece is considered a masterpiece with its own story including the magnificent Tutankhamen collection -</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-finally finish our day tour by a walk through Cairo\'s old markets authentic middle east style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- drive you back to Cairo airport then your hotel.</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; lin