ke a fantastic tour that will include: -&nbsp;<strong>pick up from&nbsp; your hotel to airport</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>pick up from&nbsp; Cairo airport</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- stop for breakfast (light local food</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the massive Pyramids of Giza</strong></span>( Khufu, Khafre, and Menkaure, the Sphinx, the valley temple of king Chephren). - enter one of the Pyramids, Great pyramid or the 3rd pyramid (optional).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- lunch (optional).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the Grand Egyptian Museum</strong></span>, containing over 120. 000 pieces of Pharaonic history, each piece is considered a masterpiece with its own story including the magnificent Tutankhamen collection -</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-finally finish our day tour by a walk through Cairo\'s old markets authentic middle east style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- drive you back to Cairo airport then your hotel.</p>');
