ps: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div id=\"itinerary\" class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\">\r\n<p>Early morning Our professional tour guide will pick you up from yourhotel then drive for roughly 2,30 hours, and then you will be transferred to&nbsp;St-Catherine&nbsp;to visit<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> St-Catherine monastery</strong></span> 220 km northwest&nbsp;Sharm el Sheikh&nbsp;and located between the St-Catherine&rsquo;s mounts and&nbsp;Moses Mount&nbsp;which is the oldest monastery of Christianity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is an&nbsp;Orthodox Greek monastery&nbsp;within its amazing walls rests a citadel like no other, incredibly rich in important religious and historical structures.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Among its treasures is a library of ancient manuscripts and icons second only to the Vatican&rsquo;s itself, and a 6th century church reputed to lie directly on the site of the Burning Bush After that head to back to your hotel in Sharm El Sheikh.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-divider-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-mgb gdlr-core-divider-item-normal gdlr-core-center-align\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"map\" class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper \" data-skin=\"Blue Icon\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js \">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
(141, 'day', 'Stopover to Giza Pyramids & Grand Egyptian Museum   from Cairo or sphinx Airport', 'Cairo', '1789262810_tour.jpeg', 95.00, 190.00, 95.00, 'Flexible', 'any time before mid day', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p><em><strong>Hours in Cairo but your heart craves adventure?</strong></em> Don&rsquo;t let the airport walls cage your curiosity. Step into the sun, feel the desert breeze, and gaze upon the timeless Giza Pyramids &mdash; a wonder that whispers stories of millennia. Make your layover unforgettable. Laugh, explore, marvel, and live a story you&rsquo;ll tell forever. Your Cairo adventure starts here &mdash; let&rsquo;s make magic happen!</p>\r\n<p>✨ Don&rsquo;t waste time waiting &mdash; escape the airport and explore Egypt with me! 🚀🇪🇬</p>\r\n<p>Here\'s your best chance to see the best heritage of Egypt and learn how the Egyptians make history. Take a fantastic tour to the massive&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Pyramids of Giza</strong></span>. See the <em><strong>Great Pyramid</strong></em>; the only wonder of the ancient world still standing &amp; also how the great pyramids where built, <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>The</strong></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Grand Egyptian Museum</strong></span> is the world\'s largest archaeological museum dedicated to a single civilization: the ancient Egyptian civilization. Located near the Pyramids of Giza, it covers an area of approximately 500,000 square meters. Designed to bridge the ancient past with the modern future, it houses more than 100,000 artifacts representing Egypt\'s history from prehistoric times to the Greco-Roman era. Its most notable feature is that it will display the entire collection of King Tutankhamun for the first time in one place, using a modern display method that combines technology and visual dazzle.</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">4- bottle of water for each person</span></p>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking confirmation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Comfortable shoes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Camera</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>Here\'s your best chance to see the best heritage of Egypt and learn how the Egyptians make history. Take a fantastic tour that will include: - <strong>pick up from airport</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- stop for breakfast (light local food</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">t</span>he massive Pyramids of Giza</strong></span>( Khufu, Khafre, and Menkaure, the Sphinx, the valley temple of king Chephren). - enter one of the Pyramids, Great pyramid or the 3rd pyramid (optional).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- lunch (optional).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>the&nbsp; Grand Egyptian Museum</strong></span>, containing over 120. 000 pieces of Pharaonic history, each piece is considered a masterpiece with its own story including the magnificent Tutankhamen collection -</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;-finally finish our day tour by a walk through Cairo\'s old markets authentic middle east style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;- drive you back to Cairo airport.</p>'),
(142, 'half', 'Submarine trip in Sharm El Sheikh', 'Sharm El Sheikh', '1789264250_tour.jpg', 70.00, 95.00, 70.00, '3 Hours', '8:00AM', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Submarine Trip 3 Hours Runs Every Day from 10:00 am to 1:00 pm, Private Trip includes, pick up service from your Hotel in Sharmand return, Professional English-speaking tour guide, Entry fees, all transfers by a modern air-conditioned vehicle and All service charges &amp; taxes, Tour excludes Personal items and anything not mentioned in the tour program.<br>Join the Funniest excursions under navies! Semi- Submarine allows you to sit below the sea`s surface and view the Fish.These Boats vary in design some look like a submarine,other are like naval ship</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Com