yle=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>our professional Guide will be with you to explain our Egyptian food and to make sure that you take the best photos of your Cairo street food tour. It is the place where food art and Cairo lifestyle come together harmoniously providing you a most unique and remarkable experience so the tour will run like: - pick you up from &amp; to your hotel. - see the local food Markets. - butcher shop where you will try some of the delicious lamb organs like (lungs, heart, liver, spleen &amp; intestine filled with Rice). - set in local cafe &amp; try the Egyptian tea &amp; other Egyptian drinks that you will like.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>free shopping time.</li>\r\n<li>- back to your hotel.</li>\r\n</ul>'),
(146, 'half', 'Unbelievable Cairo tour visiting a real Egyptian village by TukTuk ride', 'Cairo', '1789264649_tour.jpg', 40.00, 65.00, 40.00, '4 Hours', 'any time before 10:00 pm', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap\">\r\n<h6 class=\"gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title\">&nbsp;</h6>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align\">\r\n<div class=\"gdlr-core-text-box-item-content\">\r\n<p>Unforgettable tour for 4 hours starts every day upon request from 8:00 am till 11:00 pm , Private tour includes all pickup and drop off transfers from guest stay in Cairo or Giza, professional Tour guide, Our Prices Includes All Taxes Services, all Transfers by modern Private Air Conditioned Car, Bottle of Water, tour excludes Personal Items, Tipping and any Optional Tours.</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility of ridding camel or quad Bike around&nbsp; Giza pyramids But this can be added in the middle of the tour with your Guide.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">4- bottle of water for each person</span></p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Unscheduled stops</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Sitesfrom Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>You Egypt travel square Guide will pick you up from your stay at any time suits with your Schedule.. Then you will be transferred by Private A/C Vehicle to&nbsp;Pyramids&nbsp;area where Giza pyramids were Located in &nbsp;Nazlet El Samman Village&nbsp;.when you Arrive there will &nbsp;get on the TUK`TUK ride and Enjoy your free Tuk`Tuk Trip that helps you to see real life of Egyptians People and discover Their Life Style with our guide who will make sure to take you to a places you never saw it before ,This trip will show you the daily life of the Local&nbsp;Egyptians, how they Prepare their daily life Also you will able to see their Local Markets, Their Local Shops and many other interesting things Also you can&nbsp; sit in one of the local caf&eacute; and enjoy the shisha . At the End of the day we`ll transfer you back to your hotel</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>'),
(147, 'day', 'Wadi El Natrun Day tour to from Cairo', 'Alexandria', '1789262026_tour.jpg', 105.00, 210.00, 105.00, '9 Hours', '8:00 am to 4:00 pm', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Day tour 9 Hours starts every day at 8:00 am, Private tour includes, pick up service from your hotel in Cairo and return, Professional English-speaking tour guide,&nbsp; all transfers by a modern A/C vehicle, Bottle of water and All service charges &amp; taxes, Tour excludes Entrance fees to the mentioned historical places Personal expenses, tipping and Optional activities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Book Online Day tour to Wadi El Natrun from Cairo&nbsp;</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">4- bottle of water for each person</span></p>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Entry Fees</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Personal Items</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tipping</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Lunch</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</span></li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Comfortable shoes</li>\r\n<li>sun glasses</li>\r\n<li>sun block</li>\r\n<li>hat</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>At <strong>7:00 am</strong> Pickup from your hotel by our professional Licensed tour guide then drive 200 K/M north of Cairo to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Wadi El Natrun</strong></span> desert area the actual birth place for Christian monasticism.</p>\r\n<p>Basically, there were about 50 monasteries, only 4 have survived into modern times. start your trip with<strong><em>&nbsp;Deir al-Baramus</em></strong>&nbsp;which is the oldest of the surviving 4 monasteries, and in many ways the most isolated, then proceeds to&nbsp;Deir Anba Bishoi&nbsp;whose body is still in the monastery.</p>\r\n<p>Continue your trip to&nbsp;<em><strong>Deir Abu Maqar&nbsp;</strong></em>which is the richest monastery now in Wadi El-Natrun, as it has more than 100 monks and 600 workers in the extensive farm which spreads in front of it.</p>\r\n<p>You will end your trip with<em><strong> Deir El-Suryani</strong></em> which is the smallest and most compact of the 4 monasteries,then drive back to Cairo&nbsp;</p>'),
(148, 'half', 'Luxor Half Day Tour to West Bank of Luxor visiting Valley of the Kings', 'Luxor', '1789260610_tour.jpg', 65.00, 120.00, 65.00, '6 Hours', '800 am', 'English, Spanish, German, French &italian', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Here\'s your best chance to see the best heritage of Egypt and learn how the Egyptians make history.</p>\r\n<p>*-Take a fantastic tour to the massive <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>West Bank of Luxor</strong></span> where you will visit <strong>the Valley Of The Kings</strong>, the magnificence of the grandeur of architecture which was used for burial, there are many kings buried in this valley.</p>\r\n<p>Followed by a visit to <strong>the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut</strong> that was known as El Dir El Bahari which was built by Queen Hatshepsut, the only pharaonic woman who reigned ancient Egypt.</p>\r\n<p>Then continue your day Tour to <strong>The Colossi of Memnon </strong>which has remains of the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Private Professional English Speaking tour guide &amp; photographer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">All Transfers as mentioned. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">4- bottle of water for each person</span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Entry Fees</li>\r\n<li>Personal Items</li>\r\n<li>Tipping</li>\r\n<li>Lunch</li>\r\n<li>any Optional tours as entering any of the Pyramids from Inside Requires additional ticket Can be added on</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking confirmation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Comfortable shoes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Camera</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun glasses</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">sun block</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">hat</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\">Passport</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>At<strong> 7:00 </strong>am will Pick you up from your <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Hotel</span> or <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Nile Cruise in Luxor </span>or even from <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Luxor airport</span>, then you will be transferred&nbsp;to the<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> West Bank</strong></span> where you will visit <strong>the Valley Of The Kings,</strong><br>followed by a visit to <strong>the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Finish your day tour by visiting<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>The Colossi of Memnon</strong> which has remains of the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Later you will be driven back to your <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">hotel in Luxor</span> or to <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Luxor airport.</span></p>');
