(149, 'day', 'Day tour to Luxor from Aswan', 'Aswan / Luxor', '1789338358_tour.jpg', 145.00, 280.00, 145.00, '14 Hours', 'Hotel Pickup: 06:00 AM  OR 07:00 AM  Hotel Return: 08:00 PM', 'English, Spanish, German, French', 'Runs on a daily basis', '<p>Private tour roughly 14 Hours private tour Runs Daily at 6:00 Am by car or 7: 00 Am by train, Includes Pick up service from your hotel in Aswan and return, Professional English-speaking tour guide, all transfers by a modern A/C vehicle, Bottled water, all service charges and taxes and Tour excludes Tipping, Optional activities and Personal expenses.</p>\r\n<p>There is possibility to visit the tomb of king tutankhamon, horse carriage ride in the cornich st of luxor or short felucca ride on the Nile River hot air balloon but all those Excursion can be added on in the middle of the tour with your guide</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\">Transportation in private air-conditioned van. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\'; color: maroon;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'